# Ignore everything by default; allow only what each Dockerfile copies.
**
!services/tweet-service/package.json
!services/tweet-service/package-lock.json
!services/tweet-service/tsconfig.json
!services/tweet-service/src/**
!services/payment-service/package.json
!services/payment-service/package-lock.json
!services/payment-service/tsconfig.json
!services/payment-service/src/**
!build/smithy/typescript-server/typescript-server-codegen/**
!build/smithy/typescript-payment-gateway-server/typescript-server-codegen/**
!build/smithy/typescript-payment-processor-server/typescript-server-codegen/**
!build/smithy/typescript-payment-contracts-client/typescript-client-codegen/**

# Re-exclude noise inside the generated packages
**/node_modules
**/dist-cjs
**/dist-es
**/dist-types
**/*.tsbuildinfo
